## Agent operating rules

- Prefer read-only inspection before writes.
- Do not run destructive, deployment, billing, token, or external-notification commands without explicit approval.
- Use dry-run/preview commands before writes when available.
- Preserve user data and original files; write generated artifacts to separate paths unless asked to overwrite.
- Do not commit secrets, credentials, local paths, or private data.
- Cite file paths, commands, and test results in final reports.

